&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketplace:&lt;/strong&gt; builds the platform that connects Claude-powered enterprise tools through technology partnerships and deeper customer relationships. We work closely with business development, sales, product, and GTM teams, creating the infrastructure that powers partner onboarding, customer storefronts, transaction and entitlement flows at scale. We&#39;re building the technical scaffolding for a new offering, tackling the challenges at the intersection of commercial motions, platform architecture, and partner integrations so that enterprises, platforms, and Anthropic can transact with confidence.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
